Dialogue: 0,0:00:01.42,0:00:03.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes, he's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:00:04.30,0:00:08.60,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz is the Nitto ATP Finals champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯成为年终总决赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:00:10.30,0:00:13.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Historic moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N历史性的一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:00:14.05,0:00:16.32,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}北京时间{\fs78}11{\fs68}月{\fs78}23{\fs68}日凌晨
Dialogue: 0,0:00:16.32,0:00:18.14,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}ATP{\fs68}年终总决赛决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:18.14,0:00:19.53,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:19.53,0:00:22.63,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}7{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}击败兹维列夫 首次捧杯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:22.63,0:00:23.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}场全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:00:23.66,0:00:26.89,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这座冠军从小组赛开始讲起
Dialogue: 0,0:00:28.05,0:00:29.21,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首战蒂亚福
Dialogue: 0,0:00:29.21,0:00:31.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯打出两个{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:00:31.80,0:00:33.85,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一场只丢{\fs78}4{\fs68}局的小组赛
Dialogue: 0,0:00:33.85,0:00:36.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}为这一周开了个好头
Dialogue: 0,0:00:42.84,0:00:44.16,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That will do it.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛就此结束
Dialogue: 0,0:00:44.16,0:00:46.35,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}A near-perfect display{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N近乎完美的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:00:46.35,0:00:48.52,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自卡洛斯 阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:00:49.44,0:00:52.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Simply sensational, every department.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N各个环节 都出色极了
Dialogue: 0,0:00:56.15,0:00:58.49,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二场遇到梅德韦德夫
Dialogue: 0,0:00:58.49,0:01:01.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯因左腿问题申请医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:01.80,0:01:03.98,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}仍以{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}取胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:03.98,0:01:06.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}两场都没丢盘
Dialogue: 0,0:01:11.54,0:01:14.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Alcaraz makes it two out of two{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯取得两战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:14.24,0:01:16.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}this week here in Turin.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N就在本周的都灵
Dialogue: 0,0:01:16.12,0:01:18.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Even with the medical timeout,{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽管中途申请了医疗暂停
Dialogue: 0,0:01:18.42,0:01:21.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}still a very comfortable scoreline.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N最终比分依然相当轻松
Dialogue: 0,0:01:24.15,0:01:27.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}小组赛最后一场 对阵科博利
Dialogue: 0,0:01:27.07,0:01:30.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} {\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}1{\fs68}过关 三战全胜
Dialogue: 0,0:01:30.13,0:01:32.84,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}一盘未丢 进入半决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:01:38.00,0:01:41.10,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Another outrageously good performance{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N又是一场好得惊人的表现
Dialogue: 0,0:01:41.10,0:01:43.00,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}from Carlos Alcaraz.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N来自卡洛斯 阿尔卡拉斯
Dialogue: 0,0:01:43.05,0:01:45.45,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Nothing Cobolli could do.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N科博利无能为力
Dialogue: 0,0:01:52.15,0:01:54.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}半决赛才是真正的苦战
Dialogue: 0,0:01:54.61,0:01:56.27,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}谢尔顿先拿{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:56.27,0:01:57.54,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第二盘{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:01:57.54,0:02:00.96,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯在对手发球局等到机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:14.65,0:02:16.30,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yeah, there is.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 来了
Dialogue: 0,0:02:16.75,0:02:19.15,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}First break of the day.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他今天的第一次破发
Dialogue: 0,0:02:19.35,0:02:22.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}底线相持后 谢尔顿回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:02:22.37,0:02:24.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯第一次破掉他的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:24.83,0:02:27.33,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 随后{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68}扳平
Dialogue: 0,0:02:27.33,0:02:30.62,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决胜盘打到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} 最后这轮小分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:30.62,0:02:32.86,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}他只让对手拿到一分
Dialogue: 0,0:02:37.10,0:02:38.75,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}What a way to seal it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N以这样的方式锁定胜利！
Dialogue: 0,0:02:38.75,0:02:41.12,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz survives.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯挺过了这场考验
Dialogue: 0,0:02:41.12,0:02:42.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}He's back in the final in Turin.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他再次闯进都灵的决赛
Dialogue: 0,0:02:43.85,0:02:46.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}决赛对兹维列夫 首盘
Dialogue: 0,0:02:46.47,0:02:49.65,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯{\fs78}3{\fs68}次拿下对手的发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:02:49.65,0:02:51.75,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这是{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}时的又一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:02:51.75,0:02:54.46,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}拿下就能把差距拉到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:10.52,0:03:13.90,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Once more, he's got a nice cushion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他再次拉开了领先差距
Dialogue: 0,0:03:14.85,0:03:18.13,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}首盘{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68} 第二盘又领先{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}2{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:18.13,0:03:20.71,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}到了{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}3{\fs68} 阿尔卡拉斯发球
Dialogue: 0,0:03:20.71,0:03:23.42,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫拿到了一次机会
Dialogue: 0,0:03:31.59,0:03:32.77,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And he breaks!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N他破发了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:34.80,0:03:36.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}And it is game on!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N比赛又有悬念了！
Dialogue: 0,0:03:36.52,0:03:39.29,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}4{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68} 兹维列夫又保住发球局
Dialogue: 0,0:03:39.29,0:03:40.83,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}追到{\fs78}5{\fs68}比{\fs78}4{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:40.83,0:03:42.64,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}比赛最终打到{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:03:42.64,0:03:45.47,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}小分{\fs78}3{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68} {\fs78}3{\fs68}个连续盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:03:45.47,0:03:49.09,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫再拿一分 就能扳平盘数
Dialogue: 0,0:04:02.47,0:04:03.97,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Didn't get there that time.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N这次没能赶上
Dialogue: 0,0:04:09.57,0:04:11.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}That's two gone.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N两个盘点都没了
Dialogue: 0,0:04:28.96,0:04:30.07,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}第三个盘点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:30.07,0:04:33.06,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}兹维列夫在底线相持中回球出界
Dialogue: 0,0:04:33.06,0:04:34.24,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}6{\fs68}比{\fs78}6{\fs68}
Dialogue: 0,0:04:34.24,0:04:36.66,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯连续救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个机会
Dialogue: 0,0:04:36.66,0:04:38.99,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}随后又错过第一个冠军点
Dialogue: 0,0:04:38.99,0:04:41.70,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}8{\fs68}比{\fs78}7{\fs68} 第二次机会来到
Dialogue: 0,0:05:00.13,0:05:02.61,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Yes, he's done it!{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N是的 他做到了！
Dialogue: 0,0:05:03.01,0:05:07.31,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Carlos Alcaraz is the Nitto ATP Finals champion.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N阿尔卡拉斯成为年终总决赛冠军
Dialogue: 0,0:05:09.01,0:05:12.51,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Historic moment.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N历史性的一刻
Dialogue: 0,0:05:26.86,0:05:28.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fnInter 24pt SemiBold\b0\fs44\bord2.5\fsp0.6}Time to celebrate.{\fnNoto Sans CJK SC\b1\fs68\bord4\fsp0}\N尽情庆祝吧
Dialogue: 0,0:05:31.66,0:05:34.09,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}最后一拍 反拍制胜
Dialogue: 0,0:05:34.09,0:05:36.37,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}阿尔卡拉斯仰面倒在球场上
Dialogue: 0,0:05:36.37,0:05:38.80,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}起身后走向团队拥抱
Dialogue: 0,0:05:38.80,0:05:40.18,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}去年决赛失利
Dialogue: 0,0:05:40.18,0:05:43.11,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}今年这座奖杯终于属于他
Dialogue: 0,0:06:11.36,0:06:15.43,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}{\fs78}5{\fs68}场全胜 赛季第六冠 生涯第{\fs78}30{\fs68}冠
Dialogue: 0,0:06:15.43,0:06:18.26,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}这一周 你最记得半决赛的逆转
Dialogue: 0,0:06:18.26,0:06:21.01,TL,,0,0,237,,{\an2}还是决赛救回{\fs78}3{\fs68}个盘点？
